{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Eio_unix.Err</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"eio","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Eio_unix","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Err","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Wrap Unix errors as <a href=\"../../Eio/index.html#exception-Io\"><code>Eio.Io</code></a> ones.</p><ul class=\"at-tags\"><li class=\"since\"><span class=\"at-tag\">since</span> 1.4</li></ul>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-v\"><a href=\"#val-v\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> v : <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Unix</span>.error <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> exn</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>v e fn arg</code> returns an <a href=\"../../Eio/index.html#exception-Io\"><code>Eio.Io</code></a> error corresponding to a <code>Unix.Unix_error (e, fn, arg)</code> exception.</p><p>Example:</p><pre class=\"language-ocaml\"><code>  try\u000A    Unix.rmdir &quot;/tmp/foo&quot;\u000A  with Unix.Unix_error (e, fn, arg) -&gt;\u000A    raise (Eio_unix.Err.v e fn arg)</code></pre></div></div>"}